You have to find out, brother

22
00:00:53,970 --> 00:00:54,970
How to sell sweet potatoes

23
00:00:54,970 --> 00:00:55,970
No wonder the price

24
00:00:55,970 --> 00:00:57,970
I also want sweet potatoes. Give me twenty pounds in cash.
